ara-sales: Quick ask: RetailConnect wants a 10-day POC for streaming receipts -> structured JSON + a function call to enrich UPCs. They need a tiny drop-in Node or Python snippet and hosted vs dedicated pricing for about 35k tokens/day. Any known gotchas?

kevin-presales: OK. Short notes: use low-latency mode (batching off) for first pass. For streaming+function calls, show how webhook assembly works (chunks + final marker). I'll prep a compact node example.

nora-se: Node example (streaming + function -> webhook):
```js
import Redwood from '@redwood/inference';
const c = new Redwood({ apiKey: process.env.RW_KEY });
const s = c.chat.stream({
  model: 'redwood-lite-1',
  messages:[{role:'user',content:'Extract receipt -> json'}],
  functions:[{name:'enrich_upc',description:'lookup catalog'}]
});
for await (const ev of s) {
  if (ev.type==='delta') process.stdout.write(ev.delta);
  if (ev.type==='function_call') fetch(process.env.WEBHOOK, {method:'POST', body: JSON.stringify(ev.payload)});
}
```

ara-sales: Nice. Security asks: they want IP allowlist, SSO for non-dev accounts, and an audit log sample.

lee-sec: For POC: scoped API keys + IP allowlist + short TTL. Production: recommend Dedicated or Private for KMS + full audit streaming. Example audit line (redacted) will be attached in invite.

infra-bot: infra-bot: Created ticket RDW-3210 to reserve a low-latency hosted slot. ETA ~36h.

kevin-presales: Pricing back-of-envelope: 35k/day -> ~1.05M/mo. Hosted list ~ $0.00029/token -> ~$305/mo. Dedicated baseline for consistent <250ms SLOs -> starts around $2k/mo depending on GPU. I'll confirm exact numbers.

nora-se: Gotcha to call out to customer: function outputs may span multiple events; their webhook should buffer until a final event (or check ev.final=true). Also suggest KV cache for repeated receipts to save tokens.

ara-sales: Can we do a tech sync Wed 9am PT with RetailConnect eng + security? I'll include a short pre-call checklist and the mini repo link.

kevin-presales: I'll own SDK examples (node+py), webhook sample, and exact hosted vs dedicated quote.

lee-sec: I'll prepare SSO/IP docs and the redacted audit sample.

ara-sales: Invite sent. Ping here if blockers. :thumbsup:
